hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"157","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jo Ramadan ka roza iman aur sawab ki niyyat se rakhe, us ke guzishta gunah bakhsh diye jate hain.'"
"158","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jo Ramadan ka roza iman aur sawab ki niyyat se rakhe, us ke guzishta gunah bakhsh diye jate hain.'"
